## Managers

Manager identities. Names alone need not be unique.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|------|--------------|------|-------------|--------------|
| key_id | Row Key | integer | Source row key; not a person, team or tournament identity. | key_id |
| manager_id | Manager ID | string | Stable manager identifier; join using this value. | manager_id |
| family_name | Family Name | string | Recorded family name; use the person ID to identify a unique individual. | family_name |
| given_name | Given Name | string | Recorded given name, preserving source spelling and accents. | given_name |
| female | Female Player | integer | 1 for a female player, otherwise 0. | female |
| country_name | Country Name | string | Recorded country name. | country_name |
| manager_wikipedia_link | Manager Wikipedia Link | string | Wikipedia reference for manager. | manager_wikipedia_link |

### Keys

Primary Keys: key_id
